+/* GalNX P27: "stall=NNNN" in debug.txt makes the frame thread sleep NNNN ms, which is how the
+ * audio continuity test simulates the real device's 300-1500 ms SD read stalls. Capped so a test
+ * run stays bounded. "stall_at=NNNN" picks the first frame that drops (default 1200, i.e. about
